# fluxio tool-controls UI

When adding or restyling plugin/tool panels, match existing tools (`focus`, `crop`, `frame`, `rulers`). Do **not** invent one-off chip/toggle/footer styles or pull in Tailwind/shadcn.

## Shell layout (required)

```html
<div
  class="fluxio-image-editor__controls-group fluxio-image-editor__controls-group--adjustments"
  role="group"
  [attr.aria-label]="t('plugin.tool')"
>
  <div class="fluxio-image-editor__controls-main fluxio-image-editor__controls-main--sliders">
    <span class="fluxio-image-editor__controls-title">{{ t('plugin.tool') }}</span>
    <p class="fluxio-image-editor__controls-hint">{{ t('plugin.hint') }}</p>
    <!-- sections / controls -->
  </div>
  <!-- footer actions -->
</div>
```

- Inspector/forms: `__controls-group--inspector` + `__controls-main--form`
- Group blocks: `fluxio-control-section` → `__header` / `__title` / `__body`

## Presets & toggles

- Preset/mode rows: `fluxio-segmented fluxio-segmented--presets` + `fluxio-btn` / `fluxio-btn--icon`
- Active state: `fluxio-btn--active` + `aria-checked` / `aria-pressed`
- Checkboxes: `label.fluxio-check` (not custom toggle rows)
- Hints: `fluxio-image-editor__controls-hint` (not `fluxio-control-hint`)
- Action rows: `fluxio-control-row fluxio-control-row--compact` + `fluxio-btn` / `fluxio-btn--clear`

## Footers

- Preview/commit tools: `<fluxio-preview-tool-actions>` (Reset / Cancel / Apply)
- Live/immediate tools: `<fluxio-immediate-tool-actions>` (Done only)

## Styling rules

- Prefer classes already in `image-editor.scss`
- New shared variants: extend existing selectors (e.g. next to `.fluxio-focus-mode-btn`) instead of new ad-hoc systems
- Avoid unused primitives (`fluxio-chip-row`, `fluxio-toggle-row`, `fluxio-tool-actions`) unless you also style them in `image-editor.scss`
- Keep i18n via `t('…')`; add locale keys on the plugin when adding labels
